          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "एक विराम"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A place, not a setting. Pick whichever you would want to sit in.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A place, not a setting. Pick whichever you would want to sit in."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un lugar, no un ajuste. Elige aquel en el que querrías sentarte."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "एक जगह, कोई सेटिंग नहीं। जहाँ आप बैठना चाहें वह चुनें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A place, not a setting. Pick whichever you would want to sit in. This changes the whole app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A place, not a setting. Pick whichever you would want to sit in. This changes the whole app."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un lugar, no un ajuste. Elige aquel en el que querrías sentarte. Esto cambia toda la app."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "एक जगह, कोई सेटिंग नहीं। जहाँ बैठना चाहें वह चुनें। यह पूरे ऐप को बदलता है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A printable PDF of everything you have both written. It leaves the encrypted store, so keep it somewhere safe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A printable PDF of everything you have both written. It leaves the encrypted store, so keep it somewhere safe."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un PDF imprimible de todo lo que ambos han escrito. Sale del almacén cifrado, así que guárdalo en un lugar seguro."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आप दोनों की लिखी हर बात का छापने योग्य PDF। यह एन्क्रिप्टेड संग्रह से बाहर जाता है, इसलिए इसे सुरक्षित रखें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A private space for couples to reflect, understand and grow together — in your own way.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un espacio privado para parejas, donde reflexionar, comprender y crecer juntos — a su manera."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "जोड़ों के लिए एक निजी जगह, जहाँ वे सोच सकें, समझ सकें और साथ बढ़ सकें — अपने अपने तरीके से।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet daily ritual you share with one person. You can begin on your own — everything is here waiting when they join.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un ritual diario tranquilo que compartes con una persona. Puedes empezar por tu cuenta — cuando se una, todo estará aquí esperando."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "एक शांत दैनिक अनुष्ठान जिसे आप एक व्यक्ति के साथ साझा करते हैं। आप अकेले शुरू कर सकते हैं — जब वे जुड़ेंगे, सब कुछ यहीं इंतज़ार कर रहा होगा।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A read on the last two weeks, not a verdict. It looks at three things: how you have been feeling, how often you showed up, and how steady it has been.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una lectura de las últimas dos semanas, no un veredicto. Mira tres cosas: cómo te has sentido, cuánto has aparecido y cuánta constancia ha habido."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "पिछले दो हफ़्तों की एक झलक, कोई फ़ैसला नहीं। यह तीन चीज़ें देखता है: आपका मन कैसा रहा, आप कितनी बार आए, और कितने नियमित रहे।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A readable copy of your journal, coach conversations, and memories. It leaves the encrypted store, so it is locked behind Face ID.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A readable copy of your journal, coach conversations, and memories. It leaves the encrypted store, so it is locked behind Face ID."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una copia legible de tu diario, conversaciones y recuerdos. Sale del almacén cifrado, por eso está protegida con Face ID."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आपकी जर्नल, कोच बातचीत और यादों की पठनीय प्रति। यह एन्क्रिप्टेड संग्रह से बाहर जाती है, इसलिए यह Face ID से सुरक्षित है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A readable copy of your journal, coach conversations, and memories. It leaves the encrypted store, so keep it somewhere safe.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una copia legible de tu diario, conversaciones con la guía y recuerdos. Sale del almacén cifrado, así que guárdala en un lugar seguro."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आपकी डायरी, मार्गदर्शक की बातचीत और यादों की एक पढ़ने योग्य प्रति। यह सुरक्षित भंडार से बाहर निकलती है, इसलिए इसे संभाल कर रखें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A safety check runs on everything you type. If it detects a crisis, the app stops generating a normal reply and shows you support lines instead. Your partner is never told.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se ejecuta una revisión de seguridad en todo lo que escribes. Si detecta una crisis, la app deja de generar una respuesta normal y te muestra líneas de apoyo. A tu pareja nunca se le dice."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आप जो भी टाइप करते हैं उस पर एक सुरक्षा जाँच चलती है। यदि संकट मिले, तो ऐप सामान्य उत्तर देना रोक कर सहायता लाइनें दिखाता है। आपके साथी को कभी नहीं बताया जाता।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tone, not a rule. Pick whichever feels like you — you can change it any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A tone, not a rule. Pick whichever feels like you — you can change it any time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un tono, no una regla. Elige el que se sienta como tú — puedes cambiarlo cuando quieras."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "एक सुर, नियम नहीं। जो आपको अपना लगे वह चुनें — आप इसे कभी भी बदल सकते हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
