    "Pick a time you will both show up. A standing appointment beats good intentions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Pick a time you will both show up. A standing appointment beats good intentions."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elegid una hora en la que ambos estaréis. Una cita fija supera las buenas intenciones."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "वह समय चुनें जब आप दोनों आएँगे। तय मुलाक़ात अच्छी नीयत से बेहतर है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick whichever is easiest. Tap a different one any time to change your mind.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige el que te resulte más fácil. Toca otro en cualquier momento para cambiar de idea."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "जो सबसे आसान हो चुनें। मन बदलने पर कभी भी किसी और पर टैप करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pinch to zoom, drag to move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Pinch to zoom, drag to move."
