            "value": "धीमे रहें और एक-दूसरे का ध्यान रखें"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small proofs that you keep showing up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pequeñas pruebas de que sigues apareciendo."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "छोटे सबूत कि आप लगातार आते रहे।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soft green, butterflies.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Soft green, butterflies."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verde suave, mariposas."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कोमल हरा, तितलियाँ।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some things need to be said out loud. Others just need to be written down first. This is for the second kind.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Some things need to be said out loud. Others just need to be written down first. This is for the second kind."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Algunas cosas hay que decirlas. Otras solo necesitan escribirse primero. Esto es para las segundas."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कुछ बातें कहनी पड़ती हैं। कुछ को बस पहले लिख लेना होता है। यह दूसरी तरह के लिए है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something true, kind, or useful. For a hard day — theirs or yours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Something true, kind, or useful. For a hard day — theirs or yours."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Algo verdadero, amable o útil. Para un día difícil — el suyo o el tuyo."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कुछ सच्चा, दयालु या उपयोगी। कठिन दिन के लिए — उनके या आपके।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something worth keeping? The jar is only full on a hard day if you fill it on a good one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Something worth keeping? The jar is only full on a hard day if you fill it on a good one."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Algo que merezca guardarse? El frasco solo estará lleno en un día difícil si lo llenas en uno bueno."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "रखने लायक कुछ? कठिन दिन में जार तभी भरा मिलेगा जब अच्छे दिन में भरेंगे।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sometimes a week is just too much. Saying so is kinder than disappearing — the other person gets to know it is not about them, instead of guessing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Sometimes a week is just too much. Saying so is kinder than disappearing — the other person gets to know it is not about them, instead of guessing."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A veces una semana es demasiado. Decirlo es más amable que desaparecer: la otra persona sabe que no es por ella, en vez de imaginarlo."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कभी कभी एक सप्ताह बहुत भारी होता है। चुप हो जाने से बेहतर है कह देना — सामने वाले को पता रहता है कि बात उसकी नहीं है, अंदाज़ा लगाने की ज़रूरत नहीं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
