    "Tether is not therapy. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming, please talk to someone qualified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tether no es terapia. Si algo se siente inseguro o abrumador, habla con alguien cualificado."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tether चिकित्सा नहीं है। यदि चीज़ें असुरक्षित या भारी लगें, तो कृपया किसी योग्य व्यक्ति से बात करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tether will not remind either of you until then.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Tether will not remind either of you until then."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tether no os recordará nada a ninguno hasta entonces."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "तब तक Tether आप दोनों को याद नहीं दिलाएगा।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tether will stop reminding you until it ends.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Tether will stop reminding you until it ends."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tether dejará de recordártelo hasta que termine."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "खत्म होने तक Tether याद नहीं दिलाएगा।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tether. Two people. One practice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tether. Dos personas. Una práctica."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tether. दो लोग। एक अभ्यास।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Thanks"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gracias"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "धन्यवाद"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is all we will send. No streaks shaming, no re-engagement spam, no marketing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso es todo lo que enviaremos. Sin avergonzar por rachas, sin spam, sin marketing."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "इतना ही हम भेजेंगे। कोई लय-शर्मिंदगी, कोई स्पैम, कोई मार्केटिंग नहीं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's completely fine. You can take the quiz any time from Settings to personalise your insights.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Está bien. Puedes hacer el test cuando quieras desde Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यह बिल्कुल ठीक है। आप सेटिंग्स से कभी भी क्विज़ ले सकते हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The seven days": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los siete días"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "सात दिन"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The words will be deleted for good. You keep only the fact that you wrote them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The words will be deleted for good. You keep only the fact that you wrote them."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las palabras se borrarán del todo. Solo conservas el hecho de haberlas escrito."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "शब्द हमेशा के लिए मिट जाएँगे। केवल यह रहेगा कि आपने लिखा था।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
