    "This device only": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo este dispositivo"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "केवल इस डिवाइस पर"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a lens, not a verdict. It is a starting point for noticing what actually lands.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto es una lente, no un veredicto. Es un punto de partida para notar qué funciona de verdad."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यह एक दृष्टिकोण है, फ़ैसला नहीं। यह समझने की शुरुआत है कि वास्तव में क्या काम करता है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not about you. They asked for space, and told you so — which is the opposite of disappearing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This is not about you. They asked for space, and told you so — which is the opposite of disappearing."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No es por ti. Pidió espacio y te lo dijo, que es lo contrario de desaparecer."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यह आपके बारे में नहीं है। उन्होंने जगह माँगी और बता दिया — जो चुप हो जाने से उलटा है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is yours alone": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This is yours alone"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto es solo tuyo"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यह केवल आपका है"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is yours alone. Your partner chooses their own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto es solo tuyo. Tu pareja elige el suyo."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यह केवल आपका है। आपका साथी अपना खुद का चुनता है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This only picks your starting colour. Change it any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This only picks your starting colour. Change it any time."
